<h3 id="community-discussion">Community discussion (self-reported, one thread)</h3>
<p>One beginner reported a 40-second neutral-grip dead hang in a 2020 StrongFirst forum thread on getting a first pull-up. A reply said that more hanging past about 30 seconds will have "little, if any, effect" on pull-up ability.</p><p>That is one anecdote and not a norm. Read the <a href="https://www.strongfirst.com/community/threads/trying-to-get-my-first-pullup-help-needed.16956/" rel="nofollow noopener">original thread</a> (opened 19 October 2026).</p>
